Items I want to add:
Note: some items, such as Preemtive strike act as sort of one and done items, you dont need to level them as
    leveling wouldn't benefit them in any way, they act more like perks,
    whereas other items can be leveled -> increasing stats

Non-Levelling items:
- Preemptive Strike: if the potential damage exceeds the enemy health bar -> kill the enemy (no need to complete sequence)
- Auto-Correct: Once per encounter, a wrong input is ignored and will actually succeed (converted to correct input).

Levelled items:
- Chilling Jab: executing a sequence slows/pauses the timer briefly by X milliseconds
- Initial Surge: Deal +X% damage while enemy timer is above 80%
- Combo Catalyst: For every correct key, increase damage by +X% (thinking start level 1 with low number like 0.1%)
    for the rest of the sequence. Hitting an incorrect key resets the damage boost back to 0%
- Lucky Duck: increases critical hit chance by +X% (critical hits deal double damage)

Idea for Items: dont allow the player to get all items, i will limit them in a way, similar
to games like hades, where the player can only have one attack, one dash attack, etc...
but here will will have item slots, they will start with one item slot to hold and level
any item that they get, then they can find more item slots throughout the run or upgrades
in home base in between runs